      "title": "Getting started in 1 minute",
      "body": "Type in the **New task** field and press Enter. Done: the task goes to the Inbox (or to the open page).\n\n## Quick syntax\n\nThe text itself fills in the details:\n\n- `tomorrow`, `friday`, `10/15` — due date\n- `3pm`, `at 9:30`, `14:05` — time (no date means today); it reminds you at that time, and you can change the reminder in the panel\n- `!`, `!!`, `!!!` — priority\n- `#groceries` — label\n- `/daily`, `/weekly`, `/mon,wed` — repeat\n- `3x12` — 3 sets of 12; `x8` — do it 8 times\n- `@ana` — assignee (in a project)\n\nExample: `Pay the power bill friday !! #home` becomes \"Pay the power bill\", due Friday, medium priority, label home.\n\n## Many at once\n\nPaste a list (one per line), tap **Many** or use **+ → Several at once**. Indented lines become subtasks. You see a preview before creating.\n\n## Checking off\n\nTap the box. Mistake? The notice has **Undo**.\n\n## Where things are\n\n- **Today**: what to do now (overdue, due today, today's habits). It's the opening screen.\n- **Plan**: calendar, weekly review, the next 7 days, the Inbox without a date and what was assigned to you.\n- **Folders**: folders, lists and projects (and the Gym, if you work out).\n- **+** in the middle of the bottom bar (or **New** in the sidebar): creates a task, habit, note, list, folder or project.\n- **More**: everything else, each with a name and a line explaining it: People (friends, teams, clan), Game, Settings, Help, Trash.\n\nOn the phone, the two spots beside the **+** are yours: change them in **Settings → Navigation** (Plan, Inbox, Habits, Folders, Workouts, Game or People). The **magnifier** at the top finds any page, folder, screen or action."
